indico search_rooms (package operation)
GET https://indico.example.test/rooms/api/rooms/search
summary: Rooms free in a building for a time slot
tool: search_rooms
access (advisory): A: allowed
parameters:
  building (query, string, required) — Building number
  repeat_frequency (query, string, required) one of NEVER|DAY default NEVER
items at: $
example: aurora-agent call indico search_rooms building=<string> repeat_frequency=NEVER
